# Snake App Gameplay

Follow `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` §4.4–4.8 and `.cursor/skills/snake-app-gameplay/SKILL.md`.

## Controls
- Touch: swipe with dominant-axis + distance threshold; block reverse into self
- Desktop: arrow keys (WASD optional); Esc pauses
- Keyboard focus only while playground is active

## Board
- Derive columns/rows from available board constraints
- Support portrait and landscape on phone/tablet
- On orientation change: recompute metrics; avoid unfair mid-move deaths (soft pause OK)

## Naming
- Meaningful locals: `engineSnapshot`, `eatEvent`, `levelConfig`, `cellIndex` — not `snap` / `eat` / `dir` / bare `i`

## Scoring & levels
- Collectibles are tiered objects/animals with icons and different base scores
- Levels unlock via clear rules; persist highest unlocked + per-level bests
- Saving requires a local profile (see offline-profile skill)

## Audio feedback
- Eat / collide / UI use SFX channel
- Menu / gameplay loops use BGM channel
- Respect independent Settings toggles
